{"page":{"mode":"products","mainprodtype":1,"level":3,"intro":{"title":"Pujas for Family Children","description":"","descriptionHtml":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,57,57);font-family:&quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">We present Vedic pujas and Yajnas to improve and enhance family bond and relationship through blessings of the divine. We offer pujas like Greh Klesh Nivaran Puja for harmony in family, Mangal gauri puja, Marriage anniversary puja, Santan Gopal Yagna for progeny, Shiv Parivar puja for unity, Ark-Vivah - Kumbh Vivah for marital compatibility and more. All the pujas are conducted in our temple in our office premises under a team of well-versed scholarly priests. These pujas include chants of mantras and hymns, invocation of Deities for blessings, Homa, Arti, kalash &amp; panchang stapan and other rituals executed strictly as per the instructions given in the ancient Vedic scriptures. These pujas can be availed online and viewed through our live streaming facility on Skype.</span></span></p>","tabs":null,"faqs":[],"breadcrumbs":[],"bannerImage":"https://dont2qcigdrmt.cloudfront.net/CategoryThumbnail/Puja/Pujas-for-Family-Children_136113.jpg","rawIntro":{"id":22,"mainprodtype":1,"level":3,"name":"Pujas for Family Children","image":"https://dont2qcigdrmt.cloudfront.net/CategoryThumbnail/Puja/Pujas-for-Family-Children_136113.jpg","intro_content":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,57,57);font-family:&quot;PT Sans&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;